---
import TagPill from './TagPill.astro';

/*
  The draft marker, wherever a draft post surfaces. It reads the entry's flag
  and nothing about the environment: a draft only exists as a page where the
  marker belongs — `astro dev` and preview deploys — because production filters
  it out before anything renders (ADR 0021).

  A badge, not a tag: no link, and rose is a hue no tag maps to, so it never
  reads as one more chip in the row.
*/
---

<TagPill tint="rose">draft</TagPill>
